    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Inversa di P130 shows features of: in DeSMòS collega un'espressione assunta come fonte alle espressioni che ne presentano tratti senza derivarne il contenuto. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E70_Thing e come range crm:E70_Thing. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Inverse of P130 shows features of: in DeSMòS, it relates an expression used as a source to the expressions showing its features without deriving its content. The original property has domain crm:E70_Thing and range crm:E70_Thing. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F2_Expression."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E70_Thing"
      }
    ],
